Use **Global Mapper 26.2 Pro 64-bit** on the owner's local Windows.
Prefer its officially documented **.gms batch mode** through
`tools/gm26/Invoke-GlobalMapper.ps1` rather than mouse/GUI automation.
First verify the real executable/version and user-provided license state.
Use the exact syntax supported by the installed v26.2; do not use invented COM,
v27-only script arguments, standalone SDK (separately licensed), or unofficial
packages. Check the templates and `tools/gm26/README.md` before running.

Allow source datasets only from approved, legal small local
`reports/MAP-001/input` files. Never fetch Google 360 imagery as GIS data.
Output and logs stay in new isolated `reports/MAP-001/<run-id>` directories.
For every run check status, output, logfile, hash, CRS, bbox, units, datum and
NoData. "EXPORTED_NEEDS_GIS_QC" is **not** map completion.

**Map:** elevation and roads only. **Buildings:** geographic attribute and
footprint catalog separate from Terrain Builder/Arma. Do not build 3D models,
place buildings, manipulate P:/game assets, restart UIA soak tests, or merge
PRs automatically. If actual executable or data is missing, report BLOCKED
instead of inventing a successful run.
